===============================================================================================
 PHASE 0: Reproduce exact new workbook failures and document source cells, XML paths,
          dashboard addresses, derived column counts and test evidence. Do not guess.
 PHASE 1: Fix parser/typed date-time and XLSX fractional serial writer. Add golden tests.
 PHASE 2: Fix duration/SLA formula propagation and cached values across ALL eligible rows.
 PHASE 3: Correct canonical KPI aggregation, dashboard values, chart ranges and audit.
 PHASE 4: Implement independent post-export verification and block false certification.
