S. IMPLEMENTATION PHASES / APPROVAL GATES
S0 Snapshot existing behavior; collect failing Helpdesk output, original CSV, reference JSON, correct Sales fixture. Identify exactly where sales defaults leak into importer, mapping, metric engine, chart planner, export and audit.
