No automatic deployment. No hardcoding fixture totals. No replacing existing working features.

T. FINAL NON-NEGOTIABLE DEFINITION OF DONE
- Same source values preserved; semantic roles correctly inferred or transparently confirmed.
- Every generated metric has a valid formula, data lineage, units, grain, null policy and denominator.
- Every chart is valid, useful and derived from real data; no unsupported field invention.
- Every exported sheet title matches its actual dataset and contents.
- Every audit claim is backed by independent executed evidence, not decorative text.
- Helpdesk and Sales fixtures both pass; at least 3 additional unrelated domain fixtures pass.
- The system safely refuses unsupported conclusions and explains uncertainty.
- Production release is blocked until critical failures are fixed and owner approves.

